            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Up update of the literature related with the relationship between arterial hypertension and ischemic heart disease is done. The epidermiological aspects, J-curve phenomenon, relationship between arterial hypertension and acute myocardial infarction and the consequences of left ventricular hypertrophy are analysed.</AbstractText>
